# ==============================
# 📋 OPERACIONES CRUD
# ==============================

### Obtener todas las compras
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/purchases-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###

### Obtener compra por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/purchases-documents/{{purchaseFA_RI_21.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###
